on bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Hand_Crossbow\" title=\"Hellfire Hand Crossbow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Hand_Crossbow\" title=\"Hellfire Hand Crossbow\">Hellfire Hand Crossbow</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scroll of Scorching Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scroll of Scorching Ray\">Scroll of Scorching Ray</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scroll of Scorching Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scroll of Scorching Ray\">Scroll of Scorching Ray</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Any bonus damage provided by passives and conditions is applied to <em>each</em> ray. Examples include <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/30px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/40px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Affinity:_Damage\" title=\"Elemental Affinity: Damage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Affinity: Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Affinity:_Damage\" title=\"Elemental Affinity: Damage\">Elemental Affinity: Damage</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\">Hexblade's Curse</a> and the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\">Callous Glow Ring</a>.</li>\n<li>When interacting with effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\">Death Ward</a> and dealing multiple ray attacks to the same creature, assuming the 1st attack was sufficient to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"down\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">down</a> the creature with Death Ward active, the 2nd attack appears to apply before Death Ward activates. This means that after 2 ray attacks the creature loses Death Ward but remains with 1HP:\n<ul><li>If the initial attack has 3 rays the creature is downed on the 2nd ray attack and again for an actual kill on the 3rd ray attack.</li>\n<li>In the case of party members with Death Ward applied, they need to receive 6 ray attacks to actually die: 2 to break down the ward, 1 to get downed and 3 more to fail 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Saving Throw\">Death Saving Throws</a>. This effect appears to apply to all multi-application attacks such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\">Eldritch Blast</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a> (as of 4.1.1.3669438).</li></ul></li>\n<li>The incantation for Scorching Ray is <b>Ardē</b>, the Latin command <i>\"Burn/blaze!\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Scorching_ray\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scorching ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Scorching_ray\">Scorching ray</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034348\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.138 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.145 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7366/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 114365/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 41096/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.061/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1774415/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  116.559      1 -total\n 90.14%  105.063      1 Template:Feature_page\n 87.72%  102.248    100 Template:Trim\n 25.23%   29.407     16 Template:Icon_text\n 23.78%   27.716      6 Template:Item_icon\n 20.92%   24.384     11 Template:Icon_link\n 18.53%   21.595      4 Template:MdRarityItem\n 14.38%   16.757     28 Template:Ifempty\n 10.33%   12.035      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  9.78%   11.399     28 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:2530-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034348 and revision id 391269. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}